{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of being the villain in a Tower Defense? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the one who sends waves and waves of troops to break through the enemy defenses in this Reverse Tower Defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon, conquer and upgrade your troops to dominate the whole world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/7a9b5db7390753a898e6e0c9f39070dd.avif?t=1761298346\" width=616 height=70 /></span>Choose the troops, the order and the path you\u2019ll send in each wave. Think of your strategies to conquer each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.poster.avif?t=1761298346\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.webm?t=1761298346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/d1d9cdcff4e3270413d52e94a284bf93.mp4?t=1761298346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/b1decbe8a7848114d7e2934d6bd3019d.avif?t=1761298346\" width=616 height=70 /></span>Play through the kingdoms, each with their own features. Plains, forest, coast, wasteland, snowed mountains and desert, conquer everything on your own time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.poster.avif?t=1761298346\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.webm?t=1761298346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/6ffdfbdbda1247ad5d5659f496dbcbb8.mp4?t=1761298346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/5e8694ed12bb59d6934290a931806c36.avif?t=1761298346\" width=616 height=70 /></span>Unlock units, choose their profession, upgrade the stats and change their skins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/80b767365d384b547e35c06e3da077ba.gif?t=1761298346\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/80b767365d384b547e35c06e3da077ba.poster.avif?t=1761298346\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/87e695bba2c319004d738b9777f70c95.avif?t=1761298346\" width=616 height=70 /></span>Dominate each state of the region, advance without rest with your troops to conquer the whole world. But take care, the states can rebel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/1d113f87827f13b4c9eb5f170ff882a8.gif?t=1761298346\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413640/extras/1d113f87827f13b4c9eb5f170ff882a8.poster.avif?t=1761298346\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Kingdoms with 52 maps total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 Enemy defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Troops to unlock, each with 2 different professions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many skins to each troop to use at your own liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Spells to help the units through the waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skilltree with more than 50 unlocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing climate, rain, clouds, storm, mist\u2026 you can face many of them in your conquest.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tortoise formation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/c7b61b7520285a8f9a3e7e24d178c2a09e53b1cc.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a healer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/2c4864c3c1560484f379c20a2e4f400997728076.jpg"},{"name":"Is it flash?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/d9ce4998cd6419bbe643f0102e28c6ba42fb603b.jpg"},{"name":"All in!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/7bb3b42a85b9e213c59571b9262f8a835ed060cc.jpg"},{"name":"Is that you, Morgana?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/240be4db08d3aa1ee14b4abe431d6a890b2abf4f.jpg"},{"name":"Kat\u014dn: G\u014dkaky\u016b no Jutsu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/5937c275ebb405c755c72bd470a9001029c5bfcc.jpg"},{"name":"Evil never sleeps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/546812a9c9e1ad760ca6470b82f8b7aa688259d4.jpg"},{"name":"Let it wave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2413640/a